queness races, or notification-only wakeup.","Two concurrent clients are two in-process replicas sharing one schema; no cross-process, crash/restart, timing/fairness guarantee, or performance acceptance.","Revocation cancels/drains cooperative plugin contexts under a bounded test budget; it cannot kill noncooperative Go code and is not an SQL policy.","JobRetry causes explicit redelivery; the ledger demonstrates one result per job ID, not crash/ambiguous-commit exactly-once delivery or cross-job idempotency.","Uniqueness tested via sequential InsertTx with UniqueOpts{ByArgs:true} and a tagged ID; no InsertMany or cross-tenant uniqueness-boundary claim.","LISTEN/NOTIFY is enabled but a short poll fallback remains; completion/snooze subscription events are local, buffered, lossy notifications followed by causal SQL assertions.","Bootstrap observer counts retained rows but does not enqueue, deliver, or write results. Fresh fixture schemas/roles are retained; no automatic DROP.","Report requires orderly TestMain return. On-disk source and executable hashes identify artifacts, not an attested build. No credentials/DSN/database/host/errors serialized."]}
